{"title": "Unknown", "index": 10, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<h1 class=\"bodycontent-first-title\" id=\"sigil_toc_id_23\">沉思的方法</h1>\n<p class=\"bodycontent-text\">如果人不至尊地闭上他的眼睛，他就终将不再看到那值得注视的东西。</p>\n<p class=\"bodycontent-text\">——勒内·夏尔<sup class=\"calibre3\"><a class=\"calibre2\" href=\"part0005.html#bz126\" id=\"bz126\">[126]</a></sup></p>\n</body>"}]}